{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to learn about cohort-based wellness training, micro-habits, and frameworks to support daily clarity.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbf9f6;
      --card:#ffffff;
      --muted:#6b6b6b;
      --accent:#6a9f8e;
      --accent-2:#f29e8e;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --radius:14px;
      --maxw:1100px;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, #f7f6f5 100%);
      color:#222;
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      line-height:1.4;
      padding:36px 24px;
      display:flex;justify-content:center;
    }
    .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);}

    /* header */
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:28px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(106,159,142,0.12)}
    nav{display:flex;gap:18px}
    nav a{color:#444;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    nav a.active{color:var(--accent)}

    /* hero */
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:26px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:28px}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(20,20,20,0.06)}
    .lead{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted)}
    .meta{margin-top:12px;color:#333}

    /* contact layout */
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:24px}

    /* form */
    form .row{display:flex;gap:12px}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}
    input[type="text"],input[type="email"],textarea{width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e6e3e2;font-size:15px}
    textarea{min-height:140px;resize:vertical}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#7bb79e);color:#fff;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer}
    .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #e2dedc;color:#555}

    /* try it now */
    .try-box{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;align-items:stretch}
    .try-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    .try-item{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfbfb);border:1px solid #f0efee}

    /* modal */
    .modal{position:fixed;inset:0;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(10,10,10,0.4);z-index:120}
    .modal[open]{display:flex}
    .panel{width:92%;max-width:720px;background:var(--card);border-radius:16px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.25)}
    .modal .header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .close{background:transparent;border:0;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer}
    .exercise-stage{margin-top:12px}
    .circle{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff,#f7f7f7);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:12px auto;font-weight:700}

    /* reveal */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1),transform 600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1)}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
      .reveal{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}
    }

    footer{margin-top:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;text-align:center}

    /* small screens */
    @media (max-width:880px){
      .hero,.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .brand .logo{width:52px;height:52px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">W</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">Story</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Programs</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Voices</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="active">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero card reveal" aria-labelledby="connect-heading">
        <h1 id="connect-heading" style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Let’s map out your next healthy habit — together</h1>
        <div class="lead">Choose a focused cohort track, test a weekly micro-habit, and learn a framework that fits your life. Start with a short conversation.</div>
        <div class="meta">Prefer to try something first? Use the guided mini-practice below — breathing, journaling, or intention-setting. No downloads.</div>
      </section>

      <div class="grid">
        <section class="card reveal" aria-labelledby="contact-form">
          <h2 id="contact-form">Send a note</h2>
          <form id="contact" action="#" onsubmit="return false;">
            <div class="row">
              <div style="flex:1">
                <label for="name">Your name</label>
                <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="First & last">
              </div>
              <div style="flex:1">
                <label for="city">City</label>
                <input id="city" name="city" type="text" placeholder="{{CITY}}">
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="{{EMAIL}}">
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <label for="message">Message</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell me about what you want to build (outcomes, schedules) — I read these personally."></textarea>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px;align-items:center">
              <button class="btn" id="submitBtn">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
              <button class="secondary" id="calBtn" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}'">Schedule a call</button>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px">Or call: <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> — I respond within 48 hours.</div>
          </form>
        </section>

        <aside class="card reveal" aria-labelledby="mini-practice">
          <h2 id="mini-practice">Try it now</h2>
          <p class="lead">Short guided practices that fit a coffee break — choose one to run right in your browser.</p>
          <div class="try-box">
            <div class="try-list">
              <div class="try-item">
                <div>
                  <div style="font-weight:700">Breathing reset</div>
                  <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">A paced 2-minute cycle to steady rhythm.</div>
                </div>
                <button class="btn" data-ex="breath" id="tryBreath">Start</button>
              </div>

              <div class="try-item">
                <div>
                  <div style="font-weight:700">Mini journaling</div>
                  <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">A five-minute prompt to clarify what you need today.</div>
                </div>
                <button class="btn" data-ex="journal" id="tryJournal">Start</button>
              </div>

              <div class="try-item">
                <div>
                  <div style="font-weight:700">Set an intention</div>
                  <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">One-line intention + how you’ll notice it working.</div>
                </div>
                <button class="btn" data-ex="intend" id="tryIntent">Start</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">These micro-practices are free and anonymous. They introduce frameworks we use in cohort work.</div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <section class="card reveal" style="margin-top:18px">
        <h3>Other ways to connect</h3>
        <ul style="color:var(--muted)">
          <li>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></li>
          <li>Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></li>
          <li>Join a cohort: check Programs page for the current schedule.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
      <div>Serving the {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} area • Small cohorts, live sessions, and hands-on habit practice</div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <!-- Guided practice modal -->
  <div class="modal" id="practiceModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="panel" role="document">
      <div class="header">
        <strong id="modalTitle">Practice</strong>
        <button class="close" id="closeModal" aria-label="Close">✕</button>
      </div>

      <div id="modalContent" class="exercise-stage">
        <!-- content injected by JS -->
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end">
        <button class="secondary" id="backBtn" style="display:none">Back</button>
        <button class="btn" id="primaryAction">Start</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    (function(){
      // Accessible reveal: respects prefers-reduced-motion
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const reveals = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      if(prefersReduced){
        reveals.forEach(el=>el.classList.add('visible'));
      } else if('IntersectionObserver' in window){
        const obs = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{
          entries.forEach(e=>{
            if(e.isIntersecting){
              e.target.classList.add('visible');
              obs.unobserve(e.target);
            }
          });
        },{threshold:0.12});
        reveals.forEach(r=>obs.observe(r));
      } else {
        // fallback
        reveals.forEach(el=>el.classList.add('visible'));
      }

      // Modal & guided practice logic
      const modal = document.getElementById('practiceModal');
      const modalTitle = document.getElementById('modalTitle');
      const modalContent = document.getElementById('modalContent');
      const closeModal = document.getElementById('closeModal');
      const primaryAction = document.getElementById('primaryAction');
      const backBtn = document.getElementById('backBtn');

      let state = {mode:null, step:0, timer:null, remaining:0};

      function openModal(mode){
        state.mode = mode; state.step = 0;
        modal.setAttribute('open','');
        modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');
        renderModal();
        // focus trap: focus panel
        document.querySelector('.panel').focus();
      }
      function closeModalNow(){
        modal.removeAttribute('open');
        modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');
        clearTimer();
      }
      closeModal.addEventListener('click',closeModalNow);
      modal.addEventListener('click',(e)=>{ if(e.target===modal) closeModalNow(); });
      document.addEventListener('keydown',(e)=>{ if(e.key==='Escape') closeModalNow(); });

      document.getElementById('tryBreath').addEventListener('click',()=>openModal('breath'));
      document.getElementById('tryJournal').addEventListener('click',()=>openModal('journal'));
      document.getElementById('tryIntent').addEventListener('click',()=>openModal('intend'));

      function renderModal(){
        backBtn.style.display = state.step>0 ? 'inline-block':'none';
        if(state.mode === 'breath') renderBreath();
        else if(state.mode === 'journal') renderJournal();
        else if(state.mode === 'intend') renderIntent();
      }

      function renderBreath(){
        modalTitle.textContent = 'Breathing reset';
        if(state.step===0){
          modalContent.innerHTML = '<p style="margin:0 0 8px 0">This short paced breath uses a 4-6-4 rhythm. Follow the circle and the count. You can stop anytime.</p><div class="circle" id="breathCircle">Ready</div><p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Estimated time: 2 minutes</p>';
          primaryAction.textContent='Begin';
          primaryAction.onclick = ()=>{ state.step=1; startBreathCycle(); renderModal(); };
        } else {
          primaryAction.textContent='Stop';
          primaryAction.onclick = ()=>{ stopBreath(); closeModalNow(); };
        }
      }

      function startBreathCycle(){
        // sequence of phases: inhale 4, hold 6, exhale 4 — repeated for 3 cycles (~42s cycles) we'll offer 3 rounds
        const phases = [ ['Inhale',4], ['Hold',6], ['Exhale',4] ];
        let cycles = 3; let phaseIndex=0; let count=phases[0][1];
        const circle = document.getElementById('breathCircle');
        state.remaining = cycles * phases.reduce((s,p)=>s+p[1],0);
        function tick(){
          const [label,duration] = phases[phaseIndex];
          circle.textContent = label + ' — ' + count;
          // simple visual scale
          circle.style.transform = label==='Inhale' ? 'scale(1.08)' : 'scale(0.96)';
          count--;
          state.remaining--;
          if(count<0){
            phaseIndex = (phaseIndex+1) % phases.length;
            if(phaseIndex===0) cycles--;
            if(cycles<=0){ stopBreath(); circle.textContent='Done'; return; }
            count = phases[phaseIndex][1];
          }
          state.timer = setTimeout(tick,1000);
        }
        tick();
      }
      function stopBreath(){ clearTimer(); }

      function clearTimer(){ if(state.timer) clearTimeout(state.timer); state.timer=null; }

      function renderJournal(){
        modalTitle.textContent = 'Mini journaling';
        if(state.step===0){
          modalContent.innerHTML = '<p style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Choose a prompt: three minutes of free writing, then a minute to distill.</p><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px"><button class="secondary" id="p1">What small change would make today better?</button><button class="secondary" id="p2">What am I tolerating that I can release?</button></div>';
          primaryAction.textContent='Pick a prompt';
          primaryAction.onclick = ()=>{ /* require prompt selection */ };
          // prompt buttons
          setTimeout(()=>{
            document.getElementById('p1').addEventListener('click',()=>{ state.prompt='What small change would make today better?'; state.step=1; renderModal(); });
            document.getElementById('p2').addEventListener('click',()=>{ state.prompt='What am I tolerating that I can release?'; state.step=1; renderModal(); });
          },10);
        } else if(state.step===1){
          modalContent.innerHTML = '<p style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Prompt:</p><div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">'+(state.prompt||'Write for three minutes')+'</div><textarea id="journalText" placeholder="Start writing..." style="width:100%;height:160px;border-radius:8px;padding:10px"></textarea><div id="journalTimer" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Time left: 03:00</div>';
          primaryAction.textContent='Begin 3:00';
          primaryAction.onclick = ()=>{ startJournalTimer(); };
        }
      }

      function startJournalTimer(){
        let secs = 180; const timerEl = document.getElementById('journalTimer');
        primaryAction.textContent='Stop'; primaryAction.onclick = ()=>{ clearTimer(); state.step=2; renderModal(); };
        function tick(){
          const m = String(Math.floor(secs/60)).padStart(2,'0');
          const s = String(secs%60).padStart(2,'0');
          timerEl.textContent = 'Time left: '+m+':'+s;
          if(secs<=0){ clearTimer(); state.step=2; renderModal(); return; }
          secs--; state.timer = setTimeout(tick,1000);
        }
        tick();
      }

      function renderIntent(){
        modalTitle.textContent = 'Set an intention';
        if(state.step===0){
          modalContent.innerHTML = '<p style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Write a brief intention for today and one sign that tells you it worked.</p><input id="intentLine" placeholder="My intention is..." style="width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e9e7e6"><input id="intentSign" placeholder="I will know because..." style="width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e9e7e6;margin-top:8px">';
          primaryAction.textContent='Save & close';
          primaryAction.onclick = ()=>{ saveIntent(); closeModalNow(); };
        }
      }

      function saveIntent(){
        const line = document.getElementById('intentLine') ? document.getElementById('intentLine').value : '';
        const sign = document.getElementById('intentSign') ? document.getElementById('intentSign').value : '';
        if(line || sign){
          const record = {line,sign,when:new Date().toISOString()};
          try{ const list = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('intentions')||'[]'); list.unshift(record); localStorage.setItem('intentions',JSON.stringify(list)); }
          catch(e){}
        }
      }

      // back button
      backBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{ if(state.step>0) state.step--; renderModal(); });

      // primary action default
      primaryAction.addEventListener('click',()=>{});

      // Prevent real form submit; show a small local confirmation
      document.getElementById('contact').addEventListener('submit',(e)=>{
        e.preventDefault();
        const name = document.getElementById('name').value || '—';
        const email = document.getElementById('email').value || '{{EMAIL}}';
        alert('Thanks, '+name+' — a note has been prepared for '+email+'. We will follow up within 48 hours.');
      });

    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and notes for the wellness_coach site (chunk 4)

Files included:
- contact.html  — the Connect page. Contains the contact form, a "Try it now" guided-practice modal, and scroll-reveal behaviors.

Purpose and highlights:
- This page is focused on a low-friction contact flow and an interactive, in-browser practice so visitors can try a micro-habit without leaving the site.
- The modal runs three practice types: breathing, journaling, and intention-setting. All behavior is implemented with vanilla JS (no external libs).
- Sections reveal as the user scrolls. The script respects prefers-reduced-motion: if the user requests reduced motion, reveals are not animated and are shown immediately.
- No external fonts or CDNs are used. Visual texture is achieved with local styles and the project-wide SVG pattern (assets/img/pattern.svg) referenced elsewhere in the project.

Placeholders present in the file (replace when building):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Accessibility notes:
- The modal uses aria-modal and role="dialog" and can be closed with the Escape key or by clicking the close button/overlay.
- When prefers-reduced-motion is set, the reveal animations are disabled and content appears without transition.
- Form fields have labels and clear placeholders. The modal content updates focus to the panel when opened.

How to test locally:
1. Drop contact.html into the site root alongside the other pages (index.html, about.html, etc.).
2. Open contact.html in a modern browser (Chromium, Firefox, Safari).
3. Verify navigation links point to the correct filenames.
4. Try each "Start" button under "Try it now":
   - Breathing: starts a short paced cycle. Verify the circle counts and the Stop action cancels the cycle.
   - Mini journaling: choose a prompt, begin the 3:00 timer, then stop or let it finish. The timer text updates each second.
   - Set an intention: entering text and saving stores it in localStorage under "intentions".
5. Scroll the page to confirm sections animate into view. Then enable "Reduce Motion" in your OS and reload; the content should appear immediately without transitions.
6. Submit the contact form (it is a demo — it will not POST to a server). A local alert confirms submission.

Notes for integration:
- The file expects an assets/img/pattern.svg in the project for other pages and site background treatments. Ensure that asset exists and is unique per the project design.
- Replace placeholders in a build step or using your templating system.
- No server-side processing is present for the contact form — integrate with your backend/API as needed.

Design/UX rationale (brief):
- The contact page doubles as a low-commitment funnel: try a micro-practice, then reach out. This aligns with a cohort-based coaching model where prospective clients benefit from experiencing a framework before signing up.
- Practices are intentionally short and scaffolded (clear prompts, short timers) to lower friction and demonstrate frameworks used in cohort work.

If you need an alternate version with server integration examples (fetch POST or form action) or a focus-trap implementation for modal keyboard control, request an update and I will add it.
"} 
